# The menu bar by mouse: a click on each title opens its menu, in an
# open menu a title switches or reopens with the first entry selected, an
# entry chosen by click opens its screen, and a click anywhere else
# closes the menu.  The edge cells of the screen do nothing.
#@ MONOCGA
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T Retro1986
K ENTER
